				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント
・Black2ver
・カードキー（仮）を持っていない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:10:48" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>入力端末</Text>
